Package: qonlyreg
Title: Quantile-Only Regression under Quantile Disclosure
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "Masamune", "Iwasawa",
        email = "masamune.iwasawa@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: 
    Methods for regression analysis when only quantile summaries 
    of the outcome distribution are available. The package 
    implements estimation and inference procedures for 
    quantile-only linear regression, including sharp bounds for 
    conditional means, partial identification analysis, and 
    simultaneous confidence regions under quantile disclosure.
